# The computer images build from the repo root (images/hermes/Dockerfile,
# images/stub/Dockerfile): each carries the fragment CLI, of the root
# workspace. Their context is only what their builds read; everything else
# (targets, the cell's builds, node_modules, git) stays out.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!cli
!crates
!templates
!xtask
!images
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
**/.wrangler
